{"id":"37dcefa1c874faab","group":"20","path":"20/20-df-on-function-tree.md","title":"函数树上的节点、路径与限制","display":"df-on-function-tree — 函数树上的节点、路径与限制","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-df-on-function-tree","aliases":["20-df-on-function-tree"],"display":"df-on-function-tree — 函数树上的节点、路径与限制","chapter":"12","section":"12.1","source_kind":"book","verification_status":"reviewed","source_reference":"Definition 12.1.4","source_pdf_pages":[228],"source_printed_pages":[198],"depends_on":["[[20-df-function-tree]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-df-on-function-tree"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-df-on-function-tree</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-on-function-tree — 函数树上的节点、路径与限制"},{"key":"chapter","html":"12"},{"key":"section","html":"12.1"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"reviewed"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Definition 12.1.4"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>228</span></div>"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>198</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a4daa2d7bdea73d3\" href=\"?note=a4daa2d7bdea73d3\" title=\"20-df-function-tree\">20-df-function-tree</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FTree}(T)\">\\(\\operatorname{FTree}(T)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\eta\\in\\operatorname{ran}(T)\">\\(\\eta\\in\\operatorname{ran}(T)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in2^\\omega\">\\(A\\in2^\\omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beta\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(\\beta\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_1:2^{&lt;\\omega}\\rightharpoonup2^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(T_1:2^{&lt;\\omega}\\rightharpoonup2^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a4daa2d7bdea73d3\" href=\"?note=a4daa2d7bdea73d3\" title=\"20-df-function-tree\">20-df-function-tree</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}on\\text{-}function\\text{-}tree}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n\\operatorname{On}(A,T)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\forall n\\in\\omega\\ \\exists\\beta\\in\\operatorname{dom}(T)\\\n[|T(\\beta)|\\ge n\\land T(\\beta)\\preceq A],\\\\\nT_\\eta(\\beta)\\downarrow=\\gamma\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\exists\\alpha\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}\\ [T(\\alpha)\\downarrow=\\eta\\land T(\\alpha^\\frown\\beta)\\downarrow=\\gamma],\\\\\nT_1\\subseteq_fT\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{ran}(T_1)\\subseteq\\operatorname{ran}(T).\n\\end{gathered}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}on\\text{-}function\\text{-}tree}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n\\operatorname{On}(A,T)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\forall n\\in\\omega\\ \\exists\\beta\\in\\operatorname{dom}(T)\\\n[|T(\\beta)|\\ge n\\land T(\\beta)\\preceq A],\\\\\nT_\\eta(\\beta)\\downarrow=\\gamma\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\exists\\alpha\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}\\ [T(\\alpha)\\downarrow=\\eta\\land T(\\alpha^\\frown\\beta)\\downarrow=\\gamma],\\\\\nT_1\\subseteq_fT\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{ran}(T_1)\\subseteq\\operatorname{ran}(T).\n\\end{gathered}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>参数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\">\\(\\alpha\\)</span> 由值串 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\eta\">\\(\\eta\\)</span> 在分裂树中唯一决定；固定有限参数可写入程序。函数树限制不使用普通树定义中的“与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\eta\">\\(\\eta\\)</span> 可比较”载体。</p>\n<p>来源：Definition 12.1.4；印刷页 198；PDF 第 228 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-function-tree","status":"resolved","id":"a4daa2d7bdea73d3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-function-tree]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-function-tree","status":"resolved","id":"a4daa2d7bdea73d3","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-function-tree]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\operatorname{FTree}(T)","display":false},{"tex":"\\eta\\in\\operatorname{ran}(T)","display":false},{"tex":"A\\in2^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\beta\\in2^{<\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"T_1:2^{<\\omega}\\rightharpoonup2^{<\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}on\\text{-}function\\text{-}tree}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n\\operatorname{On}(A,T)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\forall n\\in\\omega\\ \\exists\\beta\\in\\operatorname{dom}(T)\\\n[|T(\\beta)|\\ge n\\land T(\\beta)\\preceq A],\\\\\nT_\\eta(\\beta)\\downarrow=\\gamma\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\exists\\alpha\\in2^{<\\omega}\\ [T(\\alpha)\\downarrow=\\eta\\land T(\\alpha^\\frown\\beta)\\downarrow=\\gamma],\\\\\nT_1\\subseteq_fT\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{ran}(T_1)\\subseteq\\operatorname{ran}(T).\n\\end{gathered}","display":true},{"tex":"\\alpha","display":false},{"tex":"\\eta","display":false},{"tex":"\\eta","display":false}],"bytes":1532,"backlinks":[{"id":"13e4a40da6a20a5c","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-e-colored-node]]；see [[20-df-on-function-tree]]。"},{"id":"8ecc018639c40052","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],